{"example_id": "ASA-02B643B785", "document_id": "ASA-02B643B785:R17-summary", "source_document_id": "R17-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/nectar-sleep-ltd-a26-1330604-nectar-sleep-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-08-12", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the presentation suggested a reduction from Nectar’s previous prices, while the calculation used competitors. The qualification did not correct that impression.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "c071e1eb41d7e32242ec518e8b72d4be98a79b14b4a525277a4cd02f25e80b21"}
{"example_id": "ASA-0D4A3788A1", "document_id": "ASA-0D4A3788A1:R05-summary", "source_document_id": "R05-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/octopus-energy-ltd-a24-1265573-octopus-energy-ltd.html", "source_date": "2025-04-23", "locator": "Assessment, issues 1 and 2, ad (a)", "text": "ASA accepted a basis for savings when comparing standard variable tariffs, but found that the ad did not adequately explain that restriction. Fixed and other tariff comparisons could differ.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "94d69fd45049a01bc07805a1cc0e7311fffcbf86ff75e65093a37d785c1153b4"}
{"example_id": "ASA-197A66A982", "document_id": "ASA-197A66A982:R03-summary", "source_document_id": "R03-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/hotpoint-uk-appliances-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-08-26", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the headline did not clearly limit the comparison to the selected brands or disclose its measurement basis and date.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "951103611b897ff10d2a179625ca075106d79e33a88bd86e66b00cfcbe3c022a"}
{"example_id": "ASA-1B553480CB", "document_id": "ASA-1B553480CB:R13-summary", "source_document_id": "R13-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/we-love-holidays-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found no sufficiently clear explanation of the environmental claim in the advertising. Using a hotel’s name did not remove that obligation.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "d4abe818b095b1ff6ddf7e7beaa5223526f433bf67e9003c25d8501b2d108aa0"}
{"example_id": "ASA-1CDA8BBDCF", "document_id": "ASA-1CDA8BBDCF:R20-summary", "source_document_id": "R20-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/motorpoint-ltd-a26-1332053-motorpoint-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-06-24", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the comparison used equivalent new-car RRPs rather than an event reduction. The supplied stock evidence also did not adequately establish availability for the relevant period.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "a7d6102f364ec12e583f8dc19b369376bf02faa2aaa039e0178706e1ee696553"}
{"example_id": "ASA-23D257297E", "document_id": "ASA-23D257297E:R19-summary", "source_document_id": "R19-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/dignity-funerals-ltd-a26-1327296-dignity-funerals-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-07-22", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the ad did not sufficiently distinguish the unattended cremation product from the funeral arrangements consumers could expect.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "3150bd5f00acad681260b08e9908b4b037a975e630ee3561d491e3ac830889fa"}
{"example_id": "ASA-2BD0CDE7AE", "document_id": "ASA-2BD0CDE7AE:R23-summary", "source_document_id": "R23-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/cablelinker-electronics-ltd-g26-1335281-cablelinker-electronics-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-07-01", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found the performance advertising unsubstantiated and exaggerated after receiving no response or test evidence. The exact fifteen-fold assertion remains unresolved here without independent measurements.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "b70abd67adedbe1fa3da77790f61653252631a1c849c934542fe95f299b71885"}
{"example_id": "ASA-4135F3DE5C", "document_id": "ASA-4135F3DE5C:R02-summary", "source_document_id": "R02-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/atr-brands-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-02", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "Sale items were excluded from the additional discount. ASA found that existing reductions did not satisfy the advertised sitewide code offer.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "e5d16f3974dc35b06ea8b8eea504396cade191683f22f308adac3cbcff91b3ee"}
{"example_id": "ASA-4E12B88076", "document_id": "ASA-4E12B88076:R12-summary", "source_document_id": "R12-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/thomas-cook-tourism-uk-company-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA treated the name as an environmental claim needing a clear basis. Resort initiatives did not remove the need to explain the claim in the advertising.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "684ec0d0ab87c97e76f82b20b172b8920220554ee9902f48fcc562bed2cf8c16"}
{"example_id": "ASA-52F4072940", "document_id": "ASA-52F4072940:R18-summary", "source_document_id": "R18-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/utility-warehouse-ltd-a26-1331986-utility-warehouse-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-07-29", "locator": "Assessment, issues 1 and 2", "text": "ASA accepted that legitimate users were not capped or penalized merely for exceeding the threshold. It nevertheless upheld the complaint about the qualification’s prominence. These are two issues about one assertion.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "cfecb7c31d71d6636666358405381b6936e84e87b310544c930b2c70733f8433"}
{"example_id": "ASA-534F069485", "document_id": "ASA-534F069485:R08-summary", "source_document_id": "R08-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/shell-uk-ltd-g24-1248246-shell-uk-ltd.html", "source_date": "2025-04-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the film and investment qualification sufficiently balanced the higher- and lower-carbon activities. The finding concerns that contextual impression, not every Shell statement.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "146bba9688a6da432335d74fc33b27a21b8f03ec09de4facef4193247a076feb"}
{"example_id": "ASA-56AB23C99C", "document_id": "ASA-56AB23C99C:R16-summary", "source_document_id": "R16-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/fenix-biomed-bv.html", "source_date": "2026-08-19", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the operation and transport of donated bodies to the Netherlands were not made sufficiently clear. The UK address was for correspondence.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "4fec8d2ab6c77c719a62fd96255bec8f3eea740bc58be2f756c6864f7e0c9b75"}
{"example_id": "ASA-6098EB83DC", "document_id": "ASA-6098EB83DC:R15-summary", "source_document_id": "R15-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/vir-health-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-08-26", "locator": "Assessment, ad (b)", "text": "The survey concerned symptoms rather than confirmed low testosterone. ASA recorded the advertiser’s acceptance of that mismatch; the advertised denominator was unsupported.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "006e005dae973eb7e89070a91c8d10dab7acc518687213efd47f7efb2b7141ad"}
{"example_id": "ASA-65DA00A0A0", "document_id": "ASA-65DA00A0A0:R21-summary", "source_document_id": "R21-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/dusk--retail--ltd-a25-1321807-dusk--retail--ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-06-03", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that frequent promotions meant the higher reference prices did not represent usual selling prices. The target is the savings baseline, not merely whether the code reduced a displayed price.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "89109093b06056cfde5a8d198cc3f5f4db790636a168929198c69fbadeb79c77"}
{"example_id": "ASA-6FFC779D5F", "document_id": "ASA-6FFC779D5F:R06-summary", "source_document_id": "R06-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/lloyds-bank-plc-a24-1244509-lloyds-bank-plc.html", "source_date": "2024-12-18", "locator": "Assessment, ad (a)", "text": "ASA treated this as business support, not a claim that all bank financing was green.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "2b1c94dceb8013aebf8a90275269c0984716612d07c9df51dab6ab48d472c2f9"}
{"example_id": "ASA-73710944BA", "document_id": "ASA-73710944BA:R07-summary", "source_document_id": "R07-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/shell-uk-ltd-g22-1170842-shell-uk-ltd.html", "source_date": "2023-06-07", "locator": "Assessment, issue 1", "text": "ASA found that the combined presentation implied a significant low-carbon share without material information about Shell’s wider fossil-fuel business.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "1600814c12695ca51a30c60d156306044bfe5a3e5eafb321c16231c8dbeac748"}
{"example_id": "ASA-7B04D1CBCE", "document_id": "ASA-7B04D1CBCE:R06-summary", "source_document_id": "R06-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/lloyds-bank-plc-a24-1244509-lloyds-bank-plc.html", "source_date": "2024-12-18", "locator": "Assessment, ads (b) and (c)", "text": "ASA understood a bounded partnership claim, not a bank-wide environmental claim.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "49fa59c7c6ded9f3f31ff4c03dc364028e52abca713d43eaa800ee3f676056e3"}
{"example_id": "ASA-7EFF069642", "document_id": "ASA-7EFF069642:R14-summary", "source_document_id": "R14-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/frasers-group-trading-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-02", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA distinguished the manufacturer’s stated RRP from the product’s usual market selling price. Evidence of the former did not substantiate the advertised saving.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "5d744079c660ce93eac79c9cfd4cd5e76de643177886c5a1995f023e07835dda"}
{"example_id": "ASA-815B3B878F", "document_id": "ASA-815B3B878F:R24-summary", "source_document_id": "R24-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/eurowings-gmbh---a26-1326605-eurowings-gmbh.html", "source_date": "2026-07-15", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA did not receive adequate evidence establishing full flight-emission offsetting. Calculating a contribution from estimated emissions did not demonstrate the claimed environmental result. This is not proof of zero project benefit.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "9264d9218cfa1f8f29fb7586ec31c8f0cddd02bbc6e987e814c2aa7755e5b795"}
{"example_id": "ASA-83A21D6D58", "document_id": "ASA-83A21D6D58:R13-summary", "source_document_id": "R13-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/we-love-holidays-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found the environmental basis insufficiently explained. The finding did not establish that the hotel had no environmental initiatives.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "486407812b3a09689da7818ef56d249e9944f1c5cc6de14ee9cbddfe4e8509cf"}
{"example_id": "ASA-8AA55F7838", "document_id": "ASA-8AA55F7838:R09-summary", "source_document_id": "R09-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/medichecks-com-ltd-a17-400386.html", "source_date": "2018-02-14", "locator": "Assessment, issues 1 and 2", "text": "ASA accepted unusually large relative traffic differences as indicative of leadership in this context. Separately, it found that consumers were not given enough information to verify the comparison.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "6502da078a942a20f0b7b7da76e899e22966ba24e54b5adb5901093acdf9ba2d"}
{"example_id": "ASA-992BF540E6", "document_id": "ASA-992BF540E6:R06-summary", "source_document_id": "R06-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/lloyds-bank-plc-a24-1244509-lloyds-bank-plc.html", "source_date": "2024-12-18", "locator": "Assessment, ad (d)", "text": "ASA found that this broader financing impression omitted material information about financed emissions.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "14f75e688078fd0f577187a862ed398b325ee0bfdac397b6d4984d3f1661df0b"}
{"example_id": "ASA-AC18ADCAA2", "document_id": "ASA-AC18ADCAA2:R06-summary", "source_document_id": "R06-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/lloyds-bank-plc-a24-1244509-lloyds-bank-plc.html", "source_date": "2024-12-18", "locator": "Assessment, ads (b) and (c)", "text": "ASA did not infer a broader environmental claim from this specific funding commitment.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "f16a477338b81ba921d9bd5915c62698b00cd22233b00da1861e0da2430b4710"}
{"example_id": "ASA-B215514CFE", "document_id": "ASA-B215514CFE:R11-summary", "source_document_id": "R11-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/onestream-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA found that the presentation did not adequately disclose the additional renewing products. The advertiser’s partial checkout evidence did not establish sufficiently prominent removal options.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "03988333e3d449d844e41f0b7831d53037ed8426b044b801ed6dd3578e7ae1ef"}
{"example_id": "ASA-B579150711", "document_id": "ASA-B579150711:R01-summary", "source_document_id": "R01-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/pimlico-plumbers-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-16", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA accepted call and overnight job records as substantiation. Reduced night staffing did not negate availability. The records covered June 2025–May 2026, extending beyond the April observation.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "8f355777027c64ae0194b2e25c410f499fcd5e3afd6ca9acda52952bed7dfe9a"}
{"example_id": "ASA-D2CEA7ACD8", "document_id": "ASA-D2CEA7ACD8:R04-summary", "source_document_id": "R04-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/huel-ltd-g22-1169110-huel-ltd.html", "source_date": "2023-02-15", "locator": "Assessment, issue 1", "text": "ASA accepted the price on a once-daily basis, but found that the presentation could suggest all monthly meals. The meal-count qualification was insufficiently prominent.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "d07fe9f1de6b0cfd9cf30772678f6da54513324554feb57e7b12ce80425c16d7"}
{"example_id": "ASA-D9185C2EC2", "document_id": "ASA-D9185C2EC2:R07-summary", "source_document_id": "R07-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/shell-uk-ltd-g22-1170842-shell-uk-ltd.html", "source_date": "2023-06-07", "locator": "Assessment, issue 2", "text": "ASA accepted customer records and the certificate-based tariff accounting applicable then. This did not establish that each home physically received only renewable electricity.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "bd770c68de121700f062ebc4624dfda9f38b36c258c80921505308f74cf5c3cc"}
{"example_id": "ASA-EC82F83F71", "document_id": "ASA-EC82F83F71:R22-summary", "source_document_id": "R22-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/parker-products-ltd-a26-1330841-parker-products-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-07-15", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA received no response or evidence establishing the usual prior price. The regulatory complaint was upheld; this pack does not turn absent substantiation into a proven false historical price.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "d4f1308a03b373b78d0bcb4f4808a3e745cfb64dbefa5020e176b658910e834e"}
{"example_id": "ASA-EF86653B72", "document_id": "ASA-EF86653B72:R10-summary", "source_document_id": "R10-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/lotus-leisure-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-09-09", "locator": "Assessment", "text": "ASA did not reject all reported initiatives. It found the broad environmental description inadequately explained in the ad or linked material.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "b5da0aa532e765fca60f28887124d7c455838018cc38f78663267965eae810a4"}
{"example_id": "ASA-EFC970E4A3", "document_id": "ASA-EFC970E4A3:R15-summary", "source_document_id": "R15-summary", "kind": "compiler_paraphrase_of_ASA_assessment", "source_url": "https://www.asa.org.uk/rulings/vir-health-ltd.html", "source_date": "2026-08-26", "locator": "Assessment, ad (a)", "text": "ASA traced the 40% result to 489 non-diabetic obese US men aged at least 45, not all obese men. Alternative evidence measured a different testosterone quantity.", "answer_bearing": true, "full_ruling_reproduced": false, "text_sha256": "a70affdbd474936a037b68776a8b708675875cf720b639bc5d74f75d70ba42e6"}
